OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer died after trampling by
OL,4,Acow, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has heard an 80-year-old
OL,7,Ffarmer died after she was trampled by a
OL,8,Fcow on her farm.
OL,10,FJennifer Uglow from Whitstone near
OL,11,FHolsworthy, Devon, was taken to
OL,12,FPlymouth's Derriford Hospital following
OL,13,Fthe incident on Wednesday 29 July but
OL,14,Fdied 11 days later.
OL,16,FThe inquest at Devon Coroner's Court in
OL,17,FExeter heard Uglow, who was originally
OL,18,Ffrom Cornwall, suffered multiple
OL,19,Finjuries to her chest.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
